ngineering <span class=\"text-emerald-600\">Tools</span></span></a><div class=\"hidden items-center gap-4 xl:flex 2xl:gap-6\"><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-600\" href=\"/\">LCA</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-600\" href=\"/cbam-calculator\">CBAM</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-600\" href=\"/electrical\">Electrical</a><a href=\"https://solarcalculator.greenengineeringtools.com\" class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-sky-600\">Solar ↗</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-600\" href=\"/guides\">Guides</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-600\" href=\"/methodology\">Methodology</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-bold text-slate-600 transition-colors hover:text-emerald-600\" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap rounded-md bg-slate-900 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-md transition-colors hover:bg-slate-800\" href=\"/#calculator-workspace\">LCA Workspace</a></div><div class=\"shrink-0 xl:hidden\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Open navigation menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-navigation-panel\" class=\"inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl text-slate-700 transition-colors hover:bg-slate-100 hover:text-emerald-700 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-emerald-500 focus-visible:ring-offset-2\"><svg class=\"h-7 w-7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" d=\"M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></nav></header><main class=\"w-full min-w-0 flex-1 overflow-x-clip\"><main class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 text-gray-800\"><h1 class=\"text-4xl font-bold text-green-700 mb-6\">Terms of Service</h1><p class=\"mb-4\"><strong>Effective Date:</strong> August 29, 2026</p><section class=\"mb-8\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2><p class=\"mb-4\">By accessing or using Green Engineering Tools (including the Embodied Carbon LCA and Smart Solar Load Calculator), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you disagree with any part of the terms, you may not access our services.</p></section><section class=\"mb-8\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">2. Use of Our Tools</h2><p class=\"mb-4\">Our platforms are designed to provide engineering utility estimates. The data and reports generated by the Embodied Carbon LCA and Solar Calculator are for informational and planning purposes only. While we strive for accuracy using current EPD databases, we do not guarantee absolute precision. Final engineering decisions should always be reviewed by a certified professional.</p></section><section class=\"mb-8\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">3. Intellectual Property</h2><p class=\"mb-4\">The SaaS applications, original content, features, and functionality are owned by Engr. Arsalan Khan and are protected by international copyright and intellectual property laws.</p></section><section class=\"mb-8\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">4. Limitation of Liability</h2><p class=\"mb-4\">In no event shall Green Engineering Tools, nor its developers, be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential or punitive damages resulting from your access to or use of, or inability to access or use the application.</p></section><section class=\"mb-8\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">5. Governing Law</h2><p class=\"mb-4\">These Terms shall be governed and construed in accordance with the laws of Khyber Pakhtunkhwa, Pakistan, without regard to its conflict of law provisions.</p></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"mt-auto w-full border-t border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 text-slate-400\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 sm:py-14 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 text-center sm:grid-cols-2 sm:text-left lg:grid-cols-5 lg:gap-8\"><div class=\"sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center font-black tracking-tight text-white sm:justify-start\" href=\"/\">GreenEngineering Tools</a><p class=\"mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xs text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400 sm:mx-0\">Free browser-based engineering tools for carbon, CBAM, electrical systems and sustainable design.</p><a class=\"mt-5 inline-flex text-sm font-black text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300\" href=\"/electrical\">Explore electrical tools →</a></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-white\">Core tools</h2><nav class=\"mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm\" aria-label=\"Footer core tools navigation\"><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/\">LCA Engine</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/cbam-calculator\">CBAM Estimator</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/electrical\">Electrical Tools</a><a href=\"https://solarcalculator.greenengineeringtools.com\" class=\"block hover:text-white\">Solar Calculator ↗</a></nav></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-white\">Electrical</h2><nav class=\"mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm\" aria-label=\"Footer electrical navigation\"><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/electrical/voltage-drop-calculator\">Voltage Drop Calculator</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/electrical/wire-size-calculator\">Wire Size Calculator</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/electrical/dc-wire-size-calculator\">DC Wire Size</a><a class=\"block hover:text-white\" href=\"/electrical/3-phase-voltage-drop-calculator\">3-Phase Voltage Drop</a></nav></div><div><h2 class=\"text-xs font-black u